# The previous form ran the guard before arg parsing with a `for ... break`
# "exemption": `break` exits only the loop, the following `if` still fired, so
# --selftest died rc 3 and the battery lost 3 assertions (oc-ship
# selftest/no-args/unknown-arg). Freeze enforcement was never weakened.
